<title>FRANCE: Sidel shares lower, seen expensive.</title>
<headline>Sidel shares lower, seen expensive.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French packaging company Sidel were down sharply on Tuesday on the back of a fall in 1996 profits.</p>
<p>Sidel shares fell 3.44 percent at 444 francs at 1153 GMT,</p>
</text>
